downtown Guerneville to wander among this quaint American town. This is another opportunity to grab a bite to eat as well or window shop! Lastly, we will take you to Russian River Vineyards, where you will drink overlooking the vines. Here they produce award-winning wines, but are farmers first and keep a strong connection to their products. They have a restaurant here, as well, where you can order delicious sandwiches and salads, or even small bites while you experience your tasting. After this, we take you back to San Francisco through Sebastopol, where you will see a different view of California countryside.\n\nAdditional Information\nTour departs at 8:30am from 99 Jefferson street\nGuests must be 21+ to participate in Wine Tastings\nPlease bring government-issued Photo ID", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "99 Jefferson street", "booking_notes": "##THIS IS NOT YOUR OFFICIAL TICKET!\nYou will receive another email shortly with your actual ticket and instruction.", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sanfranciscotoursandactivities/items/85853/images/1365218/", "pk": 1365218, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/9PbtAJDZQYy6wkEpeEiC", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/9PbtAJDZQYy6wkEpeEiC", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sanfranciscotoursandactivities/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sanfranciscotoursandactivities/items/85853/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/9PbtAJDZQYy6wkEpeEiC", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/9PbtAJDZQYy6wkEpeEiC", "is_low_resolution": true, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sanf